item.description:
CNN Heroes is celebrating 20 years of honoring everyday people doing extraordinary things. The 2026 CNN Hero of the Year will be announced next Saturday, December 5, during an All-Star tribute at 8 p.m. eastern. &nbsp;

&nbsp;In this special episode, we’re revisiting all five finalists. Vote here before Sunday night on November 29th and learn more about each of the Heroes and how you can support them here.&nbsp;

Host/Producer: Krista Bo Polanco&nbsp;

Producer: Eryn Mathewson&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin&nbsp;

Editorial Support: Christie O'Reilly, Meg Dunn, Kathleen Toner, Allie Torgan, Omar Jimenez&nbsp;
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

